      <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Government fees for a family</h3>
      <p>
        For economic programs, IRCC charges $990 processing per adult plus a $600 right of permanent residence fee (RPRF), and $270 per dependent child with no RPRF. Biometrics cost $85 per person, capped at $170 for a family applying together.
      </p>

